DTSTAMP:20261107T114104Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270121
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270124
SUMMARY:Generative AI for Epidemiology Researchers: Practical Skills and Re
 sponsible Use
LOCATION:Wengen\, Bernese Oberland\, Wengen (Bern)
DESCRIPTION:A three-day course in Wengen on using generative AI responsibly
  in research\, pairing lectures with computer practicals on analysis\, lit
 erature searching\, scientific writing\, study websites and agentic AI —
  and on where error\, bias and reproducibility break down.\n\nOrganiser: S
 wiss Epidemiology Winter School\n\nDetails and registration: https://swiss
 dataevents.ch/events/epi-winterschool-generative-ai-wengen-2027/
URL:https://swissdataevents.ch/events/epi-winterschool-generative-ai-wengen
 -2027/
SEQUENCE:0
